ow  as for the rest of moana's look she  probably would have had tattoos as well  particularly on her arms shoulders and  chest her  ink might have even extended to a  tattooed necklace so with her pendant  holding the heart of te fiti  moana would have rocked double bling her  hair should be thicker and shorter  worn in tighter curls and just shoulder  length  now we know there isn't too much  difference but what do you think of  these two looks  so now you've seen these five disney  princesses with their historically  accurate looks  do you prefer these outfits to their  original style be sure to tell us your  thoughts in the comment section below  and let us know which princess is your  favorite thanks for watching  [Music]  foreign
 

